sequenceDiagram
  actor Student as 学生
  actor Teacher as 教师
  participant StudentView as StudentGradeView
  participant TeacherView as TeacherGradeTableView
  participant Controller as GradeReviewController
  participant Service as GradeReviewService
  participant Permission as CoursePermissionClient
  participant ReviewRepo as GradeReviewRequestRepository
  participant GradeService as GradeRecordService
  participant Event as GradeEventPublisher
  participant LRN as LRN通知
  Student->>StudentView: 填写异议理由
  StudentView->>Controller: POST /courses/{courseId}/grade-review-requests
  Controller->>Service: submitReviewRequest(courseId,studentId,command)
  Service->>Permission: 校验课程成员与本人已发布成绩
  Service->>ReviewRepo: findPendingByTarget(...)
  alt 已存在 PENDING 申请
    Service-->>Controller: GradeReviewDuplicateException
    Controller-->>StudentView: 重复申请提示
  else 可提交
    Service->>ReviewRepo: save(PENDING)
    Service->>Event: GRADE_REVIEW_REQUESTED
    Event->>LRN: 持久化教师通知
    Service-->>StudentView: PENDING 申请
  end
  Teacher->>TeacherView: 处理待复核申请
  TeacherView->>Controller: PUT /grade-review-requests/{requestId}/process
  Controller->>Service: processReviewRequest(requestId,teacherId,command)
  Service->>Permission: 校验课程成绩管理权限
  alt APPROVE
    Service->>GradeService: 调整单项/总评并写变更日志
    Service->>ReviewRepo: update(APPROVED)
  else REJECT
    Service->>ReviewRepo: update(REJECTED)
  end
  Service->>Event: GRADE_REVIEW_PROCESSED
  Event->>LRN: 持久化学生通知
  Service-->>TeacherView: 处理结果与留痕
